      <p>These dogs do ${breed.kids === 'Excellent' ? 'exceptionally' : 'generally'} well with children and ${breed.otherDogs === 'Excellent' ? 'get along wonderfully' : 'can get along well'} with other dogs when properly introduced. Their ${breed.exercise.toLowerCase()} exercise needs mean they require owners who can commit to regular physical activity and mental stimulation.</p>

