      <p>Environmental enrichment keeps your ${name} mentally stimulated and physically active. Provide vertical space with cat trees and wall shelves, interactive puzzle feeders, rotating toy selection, and window perches for bird watching. Daily interactive play sessions using wand toys, laser pointers, or feather teasers replicate natural hunting behaviors and strengthen the bond between cat and owner. Consider clicker training - many ${name}s respond well to positive reinforcement training and can learn tricks and commands.</p>

