      <p>Whether you are a first-time owner or an experienced keeper, understanding the specific needs of ${name}s is essential for providing optimal care. This comprehensive guide covers everything from housing and diet to health concerns and daily care routines, ensuring your ${name} thrives in captivity.</p>
